# Protocol marker lines from FireSim queue job 610's UART (the measured SmolVLA
# flow_denoise whole-model run), in order, from its uartlog; every other line dropped.
# The only edit is stripping each line's trailing CR: the FPGA console emits CRLF and
# git would rewrite it anyway, so it is normalised here rather than left to differ
# between checkouts.  The line content itself is untouched.
#
# Kept so the receipt's UART constants are pinned to what the harness prints: a bare
# 'METRIC cycles N' and a byte-exact 'MERLIN_INVOCATIONS warmup=1 measured=1' with no
# trailing batch= field.
MERLIN_INVOCATIONS warmup=1 measured=1
MERLIN_PROFILE warmup begin
MERLIN_PROFILE warmup end rc=0
MERLIN_PROFILE measured begin
METRIC cycles 33085199302
MERLIN_PROFILE measured end rc=0
